---
import NoteFigure from './NoteFigure.astro';
---

<NoteFigure
  label="Adversarial flow"
  title="Generate a sample, then ask whether it looks real"
  caption="Reconstructed from the sketch on page 21. Real and generated samples enter the same discriminator. Labels 1 and 0 are its training targets; when updating the generator, the gradient passes backward through the discriminator while its parameters stay fixed."
>
  <svg class="gan-flow-wide" viewBox="0 0 720 310" role="img" aria-labelledby="gan-flow-wide-title gan-flow-wide-desc">
    <title id="gan-flow-wide-title">Generator and discriminator with real and generated inputs</title>
    <desc id="gan-flow-wide-desc">Noise z is mapped by generator G to generated sample G(z), which enters discriminator D with target zero during discriminator training. Real data x also enters D, with target one. D outputs the probability of a real label. A backward arrow illustrates the generator's gradient through the fixed discriminator.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="gan-flow-wide-forward" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="forward-head" /></marker>
      <marker id="gan-flow-wide-gradient" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="gradient-head" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <g class="node">
      <rect x="12" y="133" width="74" height="62" rx="3" />
      <rect x="130" y="127" width="107" height="74" rx="3" />
      <rect x="285" y="133" width="107" height="62" rx="3" />
      <rect x="482" y="123" width="103" height="82" rx="3" />
      <rect x="285" y="12" width="107" height="62" rx="3" />
    </g>
    <g text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="49" y="153" class="muted">Noise</text><text x="49" y="179" class="symbol">z</text>
      <text x="184" y="152">Generator</text><text x="184" y="182" class="symbol">G<tspan class="subscript" baseline-shift="sub">θɡ</tspan></text>
      <text x="339" y="153" class="muted">Generated</text><text x="339" y="179" class="symbol">G(z)</text>
      <text x="533" y="147">Discriminator</text><text x="533" y="182" class="symbol">D<tspan class="subscript" baseline-shift="sub">θᴅ</tspan></text>
      <text x="339" y="33" class="muted">Real data</text><text x="339" y="60" class="symbol">x</text>
    </g>
    <g class="forward" marker-end="url(#gan-flow-wide-forward)">
      <path d="M 90 164 H 124" /><path d="M 242 164 H 279" /><path d="M 397 164 H 476" />
      <path d="M 397 43 H 533 V 117" /><path d="M 590 164 H 625" />
    </g>
    <text x="437" y="149" text-anchor="middle" class="target">y = 0</text>
    <text x="476" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="target">y = 1</text>
    <text x="669" y="158" text-anchor="middle">D(input)</text>
    <text x="669" y="181" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">P(real label)</text>
    <text x="49" y="219" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">z ∼ p<tspan baseline-shift="sub" class="small">z</tspan></text>
    <text x="339" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">x ∼ p<tspan baseline-shift="sub" class="small">data</tspan></text>
    <path d="M 533 211 C 533 261, 184 261, 184 207" class="gradient" marker-end="url(#gan-flow-wide-gradient)" />
    <text x="362" y="275" text-anchor="middle" class="annotation">G step: backpropagate through fixed D</text>
    <text x="362" y="298" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">Freeze θᴅ; update θɡ</text>
  </svg>

  <svg class="gan-flow-narrow" viewBox="0 0 340 545" role="img" aria-labelledby="gan-flow-narrow-title gan-flow-narrow-desc">
    <title id="gan-flow-narrow-title">Vertical GAN flow with real and generated branches</title>
    <desc id="gan-flow-narrow-desc">Noise passes through the generator to produce G(z). That sample and a real sample enter the same discriminator with targets zero and one. The discriminator predicts a real label probability. A side arrow shows the generator gradient passing back through the fixed discriminator.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="gan-flow-narrow-forward" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="forward-head" /></marker>
      <marker id="gan-flow-narrow-gradient" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="gradient-head" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <g class="node">
      <rect x="20" y="10" width="116" height="54" rx="3" />
      <rect x="20" y="104" width="116" height="65" rx="3" />
      <rect x="20" y="212" width="116" height="56" rx="3" />
      <rect x="203" y="212" width="116" height="56" rx="3" />
      <rect x="114" y="343" width="116" height="72" rx="3" />
    </g>
    <g text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="78" y="31" class="muted">Noise · z ∼ p<tspan baseline-shift="sub" class="small">z</tspan></text><text x="78" y="54" class="symbol">z</text>
      <text x="78" y="126">Generator</text><text x="78" y="154" class="symbol">G<tspan baseline-shift="sub" class="subscript">θɡ</tspan></text>
      <text x="78" y="234" class="muted">Generated</text><text x="78" y="258" class="symbol">G(z)</text>
      <text x="261" y="234" class="muted">Real data</text><text x="261" y="258" class="symbol">x</text>
      <text x="172" y="367">Discriminator</text><text x="172" y="397" class="symbol">D<tspan baseline-shift="sub" class="subscript">θᴅ</tspan></text>
    </g>
    <g class="forward" marker-end="url(#gan-flow-narrow-forward)">
      <path d="M 78 69 V 98" /><path d="M 78 174 V 206" />
      <path d="M 78 273 V 310 H 147 V 337" /><path d="M 261 273 V 310 H 198 V 337" />
      <path d="M 172 420 V 450" />
    </g>
    <text x="59" y="295" text-anchor="end" class="target">y = 0</text><text x="280" y="295" class="target">y = 1</text>
    <text x="172" y="475" text-anchor="middle">D(input) · P(real label)</text>
    <path d="M 236 379 H 329 V 137 H 142" class="gradient" marker-end="url(#gan-flow-narrow-gradient)" />
    <text x="228" y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="annotation">G gradient</text>
    <text x="172" y="514" text-anchor="middle" class="annotation">G step: freeze θᴅ; update θɡ</text>
    <text x="172" y="536" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">Backpropagate through fixed D</text>
  </svg>
</NoteFigure>

<style>
  svg { display: block; height: auto; width: 100%; }
  .gan-flow-narrow { display: none; }
  text { fill: var(--ink); font-size: 15px; }
  .symbol { font-size: 24px; font-style: italic; }
  .subscript { font-size: 13px; }
  .small { font-size: 10px; }
  .node { fill: var(--paper); stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .muted { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .target { font-size: 14px; }
  .forward, .forward-head { fill: none; stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .gradient, .gradient-head { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .gradient { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .annotation { fill: var(--accent); font-size: 14px; }
  @container (max-width: 580px) { .gan-flow-wide { display: none; } .gan-flow-narrow { display: block; max-width: 390px; margin-inline: auto; } }
</style>
